Bugfix: Always verify the signature of installed app packages

We've changed the installer to verify the signature of every app package it
installs or updates, also when the package ships no signature. Where code
signing is enforced, an unsigned app is now only installed when it is listed
in `integrity.ignore.missing.app.signature`. An app archive must contain
exactly one app folder, named after the app id in its info.xml, and the app id
must be a valid one.

https://github.com/owncloud/core/pull/41955
